[Other responses]

{COLIN: Feel free to add however many responses you want here. The Sorrow should respond to each one based on the player's Tides, and Matkina and the First should also respond to it to show whether they are appeased by it. There should be at least one answer that appeases both of them.

In the responses above, I've found it's easiest to show Matkina/First appeasement before the Sorrow's answer, but then to let anyone who wants to protest do so after the Sorrow's reaction. It's probably easiest if every answer appeases at least one of them (so you don't have to deal with a double protest). -AH}

